  "$comment": "Source-pixel spec (1536x1024 \u2192 36x24) \u2014 an Indiranagar residential lane at five o'clock (story 4.1, ADR-148). The lane runs left \u2192 right: top pavement y 300\u2013410, tarmac y 410\u2013600, bottom pavement y 600\u2013690; the houses above and below are solid (their balconies are where the plate-bangers stand); two side lanes open off it (top-left x 320\u2013400, bottom-right x 1000\u20131070) \u2014 that is where they walk out from. Parked cars, the covered scooter, the auto with its flaps open and the tanker are blocks; tree trunks are blocks and the canopies hang above (you walk under them). The main road on the right edge is the way out; its median is solid. The neighbours stand at their front gates (top row) and on their rooftop terraces (bottom row): the balconies themselves are off-screen from the lane.",
